Licensing scope for this mixed-source repository

Original adaptation glue authored for this project (the runtime Python/shell
helpers, original rotation adapters, documentation and original packaging logic)
is available under the MIT terms in LICENSES/MIT.txt.

Kernel-derived display cleanup/repair material, including src/display_repair.S,
kernel/display-cleanup/ and the corresponding derived repair logic, remains
under the applicable Linux GPL-2.0 terms. Original upstream notices take priority.

kernel/zram/source/ contains Linux-derived ZRAM, zsmalloc and LZO code and retains
its upstream kernel license notices; it is not relicensed under the MIT glue
license. Source/build details and retained license texts are in kernel/zram/
and LICENSES/zram/.

third_party/mali-valhall/ retains its upstream license.txt and per-file notices,
including GPL-2.0 WITH Linux-syscall-note declarations where present.

This scope does not relicense inherited KNULLI/Linux/emulator binaries, vendor
Mali userspace, stock Wi-Fi firmware/modules, BIOS files or other third-party
content of the firmware image. See docs/SOURCES_AND_LICENSES.md.
